<view class="container">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">{{nickname || '球员'}}</view>
    <view class="muted">本地开发登录账号</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">入口</view>
  <view class="card row" bindtap="goRecommend">
    <text>现在练什么</text>
    <text class="muted">规则推荐</text>
  </view>
  <view class="card row" bindtap="goTips">
    <text>训练贴士</text>
    <text class="muted">></text>
  </view>
  <view class="card row" bindtap="goErrors">
    <text>常见错误</text>
    <text class="muted">></text>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">上传视频记录</view>
  <view class="banner-note">姿态分析尚未开放，不返回分数。此处仅展示上传与任务状态。</view>
  <view class="muted" wx:if="{{loading}}">加载中…</view>
  <view class="muted" wx:elif="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
  <view
    class="card"
    wx:for="{{videos}}"
    wx:key="id"
    bindtap="goVideoDetail"
    data-id="{{item.id}}"
  >
    <view class="row">
      <text class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:0;">{{item.skill_name}}</text>
      <text class="tag warn">{{item.jobStatusLabel}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="muted" style="margin-top:8rpx;">
      时长 {{item.durationText}} · {{item.orientation || '-'}} · {{item.createdText}}
    </view>
    <view class="muted" wx:if="{{item.jobErrorCode}}">{{item.jobErrorCode}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="muted" wx:if="{{!loading && !error && !videos.length}}">
    暂无上传视频。去「技术库」→ 拍摄引导 → 上传。
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">打卡记录</view>
  <view class="card" wx:for="{{sessions}}" wx:key="id">
    <view class="row">
      <text>{{item.session_date}}</text>
      <text class="tag" wx:if="{{item.rating}}">自评 {{item.rating}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="muted">{{item.notes || '已完成训练打卡'}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="muted" wx:if="{{!sessions.length}}">暂无打卡，去「训练」页完成一日计划吧。</view>
</view>
